    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:00:00Z",
      "text": "Israeli president officially tasks Eisenkot with forming government, France 24 reports.",
      "cites": [
        "news:france24:c83bf488fa4c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On 3 November 2026, United States President Donald Trump announced that the United States would cease providing nearly 4 billion dollars in aid to Israel by December 2026, and that this had been proposed by Netanyahu.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384509983:395"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:00:16Z",
      "text": "Benjamin \"Bibi\" Netanyahu (born 21 October 1949) is an Israeli politician and diplomat who has served as prime minister of Israel since 2022.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1384509983:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:00:24Z",
      "text": "Benjamin Netanyahu was born on 21 October 1949 in Tel Aviv.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q43723:P569",
        "wd:Q43723:P19"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:00:32Z",
      "text": "Educated at Cheltenham High School, MIT Sloan School of Management and Massachusetts Institute of Technology.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q43723:P69:Q5090207",
        "wd:Q43723:P69:Q142740",
        "wd:Q43723:P69:Q49108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:00:38Z",
      "text": "Worked for Boston Consulting Group, in Jerusalem.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q43723:P108:Q135635",
        "wd:Q43723:P937:Q1218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:00:44Z",
      "text": "5 awards on record, among them Irving Kristol Award (2015) and Grand Cross of the Order of the Southern Cross (2019).",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q43723:P166:Q6074664",
        "wd:Q43723:P166:Q22058319"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:00:51Z",
      "text": "Known for A Place Among the Nations, Fighting Terrorism and Bibi: My Story.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q43723:P800:Q16133305",
        "wd:Q43723:P800:Q20502069",
        "wd:Q43723:P800:Q114244190"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:01:07Z",
      "text": "France 24 headlined it: “Israeli president officially tasks Eisenkot with forming government”",
      "cites": [
        "news:france24:c83bf488fa4c"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:01:14Z",
      "text": "Al Jazeera headlined it: “Will Eisenkot be able to form Israel’s next gov’t amid divided opposition?”",
      "cites": [
        "news:aljazeera:e6cc7419b188"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-08T00:01:21Z",
      "text": "The Guardian headlined it: “Israel’s president picks Yashar leader Gadi Eisenkot to form government”",
      "cites": [
        "news:guardian:fe43e4b6ce3d"
      ]
    },
    {
